WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:03.167
-Did you get the cotton candy
out of your nose or whatever?

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:04.634
-In my nose. And, like -- and
the cotton candy with the water

00:00:04.634 --> 00:00:05.901
just makes sugar everywhere.
Yeah.

00:00:05.901 --> 00:00:08.200
-Tough act to follow you
with Aaron Judge, man.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.501
Whew!
-How about you --

00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:10.734
-What a stud that dude is.

00:00:10.734 --> 00:00:12.400
-How about you two studs
in the hallway?

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.701
Back there, I'm like,
"Oh, my gosh."

00:00:13.701 --> 00:00:16.000
-What is he, 7'4"?
-8'9."

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:17.000
-He's huge!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.067
-8 foot 9 --
[ Laughs ]

00:00:19.067 --> 00:00:21.200
He's just a beast of a dude.
-He's a big dude.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:23.434
-Yeah, nice guy.
Hey, I want to get to you.

00:00:23.434 --> 00:00:25.033
Come on.
-Okay, sorry.

00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:26.601
-I missed you.
Since I've seen you,

00:00:26.601 --> 00:00:27.734
you actually got married
a few months ago.

00:00:27.734 --> 00:00:29.167
-I did!
-Congratulations.

00:00:29.167 --> 00:00:30.767
-Thank you.
-I'm so happy for you, bud.

00:00:30.767 --> 00:00:33.667
-Thank you.
-That's awesome.

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:35.968
-I did. I did.
Barely.

00:00:35.968 --> 00:00:37.501
-Yeah, barely.
No -- barely.

00:00:37.501 --> 00:00:39.601
-Barely.
Oh, I mean, I had a little

00:00:39.601 --> 00:00:42.133
mishap the night before.
-Yeah?

00:00:42.133 --> 00:00:43.901
-The night before -- so,
the night before the wedding,

00:00:43.901 --> 00:00:47.601
we had this party, like,
a wedding rehearsal,

00:00:47.601 --> 00:00:49.133
dinner rehearsal.
-Yeah.

00:00:49.133 --> 00:00:51.701
-And we had a party bus, and we
had a band and the whole thing.

00:00:51.701 --> 00:00:54.534
And I tried to do this Russian
sort of gymnast routine

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:56.367
in the back of the party bus
on the way home,

00:00:56.367 --> 00:00:58.868
and I threw my back out.
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:00:58.868 --> 00:01:00.767
And I didn't know it
until the next morning

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:02.801
when I couldn't get out of bed.
-Wedding --

00:01:02.801 --> 00:01:07.767
-Went to the hospital, got shot
up, medication, perfectly fine.

00:01:07.767 --> 00:01:11.834
I was -- I was mostly worried
because I'm a bit older

00:01:11.834 --> 00:01:16.734
than she is,
and so I figured if --

00:01:16.734 --> 00:01:18.067
if I don't make it down the --

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:19.767
if I can't walk down
the aisle...

00:01:19.767 --> 00:01:22.100
[ Laughter ]
-You'll never --

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:23.400
You'll never outlive that.
It's like, "Here he comes."

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:25.200
-Can you imagine a walker?
-"Come on, Grandpa!

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:27.300
Come on!
Come on, Grandpa!

00:01:27.300 --> 00:01:29.000
It's your wedding day!"
-"I'm coming! I'm coming!"

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.734
-"Don't play any music!"
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:32.734 --> 00:01:35.300
-I mean, it was a --
it was a real possibility.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:36.968
-But you made it.
-I was thinking, wheelchair,

00:01:36.968 --> 00:01:39.267
crutches, or a walker.
-You made it.

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:40.334
-I made it.

00:01:40.334 --> 00:01:41.968
-At least put the aisle
downhill.

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:44.033
So, you don't have to --
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.033 --> 00:01:46.400
You don't have to do any work.
But, no, you made it.

00:01:46.400 --> 00:01:48.000
Not only that, you crushed it.

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:49.534
You sent us a video
of the wedding.

00:01:49.534 --> 00:01:51.000
I want to show this
and then talk about this.

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.467
Here's Josh Duhamel.

00:01:52.467 --> 00:01:56.033
-♪ Lay your weary head to rest ♪

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:58.167
♪ Don't you cry no more ♪

00:01:58.167 --> 00:01:59.667
-Yeah!

00:01:59.667 --> 00:02:01.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:07.534
♪♪

00:02:07.534 --> 00:02:09.968
-Come on, that's --
-I mean --

00:02:09.968 --> 00:02:11.901
-"Carry on my Wayward --"
-What do you guys think?

00:02:11.901 --> 00:02:13.200
-"Carry on Wayward Son."

00:02:13.200 --> 00:02:14.534
Roots say "thumbs up."
There you go.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.868
They love it.
Dude, that's pretty great.

00:02:16.868 --> 00:02:18.868
-Oh.
Well, I also had Chris Hawkey

00:02:18.868 --> 00:02:20.367
in the background there sort of

00:02:20.367 --> 00:02:22.033
making me sound a lot better
than I was.

00:02:22.033 --> 00:02:23.801
-But is that --
is that your go-to song?

00:02:23.801 --> 00:02:25.534
Have you done that before?
-No, they were singing it.

00:02:25.534 --> 00:02:27.667
And I knew the -- I knew, like,
the main verse to the song.

00:02:27.667 --> 00:02:28.734
I didn't know
the rest of the lyrics.

00:02:28.734 --> 00:02:30.601
I was like,
"I'm gonna get up there."

00:02:30.601 --> 00:02:32.067
-Yeah.
-So, I went up and I --

00:02:32.067 --> 00:02:34.100
I just -- it was my wedding.
I can do what I want to, right?

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.734
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.734 --> 00:02:37.100
And you're on all that
back medication.

00:02:37.100 --> 00:02:38.801
Might as well just go for it.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.801 --> 00:02:40.467
-I was -- I was high!
-You won't remember this

00:02:40.467 --> 00:02:42.067
till tomorrow anyway.
Yeah, exactly, yeah.

00:02:42.067 --> 00:02:44.334
-I don't remember any of that.
-Dude, that's fantastic.

00:02:44.334 --> 00:02:47.601
That's a fun -- that's a fun
human being to have at a party.

00:02:47.601 --> 00:02:49.033
That looks like a concert.
-Thank you.

00:02:49.033 --> 00:02:50.601
I don't remember any of it,
but, yeah, it was good.

00:02:50.601 --> 00:02:52.200
[ Laughter ]

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:53.434
-Let's -- can we talk about
"Shotgun Wedding"?

00:02:53.434 --> 00:02:55.000
-Yeah, sure, sure.
-Jennifer Lopez.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:57.367
-Yeah.
-One of our pals of all pals.

00:02:57.367 --> 00:02:58.634
I love Jennifer Lopez.
-Me too.

00:02:58.634 --> 00:03:00.634
-How long have you known
Jennifer?

00:03:00.634 --> 00:03:03.000
-I met her, like, 15 years ago.
-Yeah.

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:05.200
-So, I've known her -- you know,
certainly, we'd run into

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.534
each other here and there over
the last however many years.

00:03:07.534 --> 00:03:10.267
But it came up, and they wanted
me to do the part, and we met,

00:03:10.267 --> 00:03:13.200
and the main thing was for me
was, we have to make sure that,

00:03:13.200 --> 00:03:15.634
you know,
they believe us as a couple.

00:03:15.634 --> 00:03:16.734
-Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
-You know?

00:03:16.734 --> 00:03:19.133
-Of course.
-Because, you know,

00:03:19.133 --> 00:03:21.968
she's a huge superstar.
And it's hard to, like, get --

00:03:21.968 --> 00:03:23.667
you would think it would be hard
to get to her that way.

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:25.367
But she's not.
She's, like, the --

00:03:25.367 --> 00:03:26.534
she's still
"Jenny from the block."

00:03:26.534 --> 00:03:28.334
-Oh, yeah.
-She really is.

00:03:28.334 --> 00:03:30.501
She really is still
"Jenny from the block."

00:03:30.501 --> 00:03:32.734
-But I can see you guys --
I think it's perfect.

00:03:32.734 --> 00:03:34.334
-I would watch anything
you guys did together.

00:03:34.334 --> 00:03:35.868
-Oh, thank you.
It's a fun movie.

00:03:35.868 --> 00:03:37.300
-I love that.
I love her.

00:03:37.300 --> 00:03:39.934
I love you, you guys together.
You're both funny.

00:03:39.934 --> 00:03:42.968
She's -- She's a pro.
-I mean, she is.

00:03:42.968 --> 00:03:45.968
But, you know,
with some really nice editing,

00:03:45.968 --> 00:03:47.400
they made me funny, too,
believe it or not.

00:03:47.400 --> 00:03:48.934
-No, no.
You're always funny.

00:03:48.934 --> 00:03:51.601
Where did you film it?
-Dominican Republic.

00:03:51.601 --> 00:03:52.767
Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:52.767 --> 00:03:54.901
You ever been?
-No, I'm dying to go.

00:03:54.901 --> 00:03:56.367
-Dude, it's beautiful.
-It's just gorgeous, right?

00:03:56.367 --> 00:03:58.968
-It is, it is.
-It almost feels like not work.

00:03:58.968 --> 00:04:01.734
-Well, that's the beauty of this
job is you get to go places

00:04:01.734 --> 00:04:03.834
you would never otherwise see.
And then not only that

00:04:03.834 --> 00:04:06.167
but see places -- you're not
just going to Punta Cana,

00:04:06.167 --> 00:04:08.701
you're going to, like,
north, south, east, west

00:04:08.701 --> 00:04:10.667
of, you know, all the most
beautiful spots.

00:04:10.667 --> 00:04:12.634
-Yeah.
-So, we had a blast

00:04:12.634 --> 00:04:15.067
with Lenny Kravitz
and Cheech Marin and...

00:04:15.067 --> 00:04:17.667
-Yeah.
-...and Jennifer Coolidge.

00:04:17.667 --> 00:04:18.801
-Jennifer Coolidge,
by the way --

00:04:18.801 --> 00:04:20.000
-Jennifer Cool-- yeah.

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:21.667
-Jennifer Coolidge
plays your mom in this.

00:04:21.667 --> 00:04:22.801
-She plays --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:22.801 --> 00:04:24.067
She had me when she was 7.

00:04:24.067 --> 00:04:25.367
-Yeah, of course.
-Yeah, yeah.

00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:26.667
-Dude, how fun
is Jennifer Coolidge?

00:04:26.667 --> 00:04:28.367
-She's amazing!
I mean, Jennifer Coolidge

00:04:28.367 --> 00:04:30.868
is a -- she reminds me
a little bit of

00:04:30.868 --> 00:04:33.801
what it might've been like
to work with an Andy Kaufman

00:04:33.801 --> 00:04:36.367
or, like, Bill Murray or
somebody who you never know

00:04:36.367 --> 00:04:37.434
what the hell they're gonna do.

00:04:37.434 --> 00:04:38.501
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:38.501 --> 00:04:40.167
-Because she would
just do things.

00:04:40.167 --> 00:04:42.033
We're all like,
"Do you want another take?"

00:04:42.033 --> 00:04:43.234
She's like, "No, I'm good."

00:04:43.234 --> 00:04:44.567
Like, "I guess that's what
you want to do."

00:04:44.567 --> 00:04:46.934
And then you see it on screen,
and it's brilliant.

00:04:46.934 --> 00:04:48.434
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.
She nailed it.

00:04:48.434 --> 00:04:50.634
-She's amazing.
And she's so chill.

00:04:50.634 --> 00:04:52.100
She's just --
she's an amazing woman.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:53.467
-It's kind of got everything
in it.

00:04:53.467 --> 00:04:56.501
It's got comedy, it's romantic,
but also, it's action.

00:04:56.501 --> 00:04:57.767
-Yeah.
-How do we --

00:04:57.767 --> 00:05:00.400
-Big, broad sort of action.
-Yes.

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.200
But how do we --
There's pirates involved.

00:05:02.200 --> 00:05:04.334
-There are pi-- yes.
There are pirates involved

00:05:04.334 --> 00:05:06.167
who take over this island.
-Yeah.

00:05:06.167 --> 00:05:07.934
-Or this -- yeah, this island
in the Philippines.

00:05:07.934 --> 00:05:09.033
We shot it in the Dominican,

00:05:09.033 --> 00:05:10.701
but it's supposed to be
the Philippines.

00:05:10.701 --> 00:05:14.267
And they sort of --
they overtake the wedding

00:05:14.267 --> 00:05:18.133
to sort of take ransom --
take money from her father.

00:05:18.133 --> 00:05:20.334
-Yeah. And the only two people
that they didn't capture --

00:05:20.334 --> 00:05:22.067
-Yeah, 'cause we were off
having a little tiff

00:05:22.067 --> 00:05:24.534
before the actual event, so...
-I want to show a clip.

00:05:24.534 --> 00:05:26.901
Here are Josh Duhamel
and Jennifer Lopez

00:05:26.901 --> 00:05:29.434
in "Shotgun Wedding."
Take a look at this.

00:05:29.434 --> 00:05:32.100
-[ Grunting ]

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:33.601
-Aah!
-Cliff! Cliff!

00:05:33.601 --> 00:05:35.968
-I see it!
Get it into park!

00:05:35.968 --> 00:05:36.968
-I'm trying!

00:05:36.968 --> 00:05:38.634
[ Both grunting ]

00:05:38.634 --> 00:05:40.334
-Oh, God!
Oh, my God!

00:05:40.334 --> 00:05:43.300
-[ Grunting ]

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:45.367
-Oh! Slide down!

00:05:45.367 --> 00:05:46.367
Oh!

00:05:46.367 --> 00:05:48.200
[ Sighs ]
-Oh!

00:05:48.200 --> 00:05:49.601
[ Both laugh ]

00:05:49.601 --> 00:05:51.167
-Unh!
-Ohh!

00:05:51.167 --> 00:05:54.067
-My dress!
My dress is caught!

00:05:54.067 --> 00:05:56.133
Don't let go!
-Don't you let go!

00:05:56.133 --> 00:05:58.000
-Come on!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.868
Josh Duhamel, everybody!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:06:01.868 --> 00:06:04.234
"Shotgun Wedding"
begins streaming this Friday

00:06:04.234 --> 00:06:05.634
on Prime Video.

00:06:05.634 --> 00:06:07.667
We'll be right back with more
"Tonight Show," everybody.

00:06:07.667 --> 00:06:09.634
Josh Duhamel, come on.

